{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "92ff9f2e-a801-535d-a7cd-f51cea7bdc5d", "source_ordinal": 2598, "reading_ordinal": 1455, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "你先走", "published_at": "2022-09-10T20:45:47+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/436852247/answer/2668207151"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "借这个问题说说这个原谅顺序问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问题是这样的——一件恶果发生了，你和对方都是参与方，现在有一个定责和原谅的问题。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是先原谅自己，还是先原谅对方？", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个关键看走哪条路线更容易达成完全原谅。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不过，原谅的定义要先看清楚——原谅不等于宽恕、免罚。原谅是指在承担完应分的责任后，关系可以继续保持友好。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "它完全注重在“关系是否能继续保持友好”上。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而“友好”的定义不是指“如同之前那样亲密”，而是指“没有留存的怨恨和恶意”，即双方的关系至少恢复到了一个非敌对的、无恶意的状态。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "免罚，那属于宽恕范畴的问题，不属于原谅这个部门。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "原谅归原谅，宽恕归宽恕。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "原谅是一种客观的义务，而宽恕并不是。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "宽恕是纯粹的自由权柄，不容别人强求。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你不原谅人，客观世界的规则会给你带来负面影响，也就是它会惩罚你。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但是你不宽恕人，客观世界却对此是中立的，它只是容易对喜欢宽恕人的给予奖励。但不宽恕并无额外的惩罚。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为要求对方为自己的过犯付出承诺的代价并不成其为一种不义。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "回到先原谅谁的问题上来。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为原谅是义务，意味着达成“双双原谅”就是一个终究要达成的目标。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那么先原谅谁，就主要看如何低成本的、痛苦总量最少的达到这个目标。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而这里有一个天然的问题——", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如果你先原谅自己，那么罪责自然要更多的落到对方那边。而同样的罪责，你显然的更容易原谅自己而苛责ta人。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "善于寻求双重原谅的人，很自然的会发现——先把错误和罪责偏向自己这一边，然后对方身上的责任就变轻了，原谅起来就比较容易了。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "而不管你怪多少在自己身上，你自己总是比较容易得到自己的原谅的。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "注意，这里并没有主张你把全部责任都默认归于自身。这样做你很容易在客观上不知不觉的以神自居。这造成的后果甚至远比不尽原谅的义务严重得多。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 729}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你只能承担人类能力范围内的责任，对方也是。", "char_start": 730, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "事情很可能是整件事虽然失败，但错误却不见得在任何一个参与者身上，而在历史局限上、客观的绝对无知上——也就是在老天爷身上。", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "谁的错都不是。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 820}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "很多人之所以下意识的要往别人身上推责任，是因为ta把老天爷、上帝这个因素排除掉了，导致有一份极其可怕的、没人承担得起的责任，谁担着谁就要粉身碎骨，那只好“死道友不死贫道，洒家必定年年给你上坟”了。", "char_start": 821, "char_end": 919}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "综上，答案是要先原谅对方，再原谅自己。", "char_start": 921, "char_end": 940}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：原谅自己和原谅别人哪种更困难?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“你先走”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“借这个问题说说这个原谅顺序问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "借这个问题说说这个原谅顺序问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "50c61030-a6e7-5245-92fc-c14de6061caa", "source_ordinal": 2597, "reading_ordinal": 1456, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "强大", "published_at": "2022-09-16T20:57:10+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/54957651/answer/2676679840"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "事实上，美军只是一只不成熟的半成品军队。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为美军缺乏一支真正的军队最基本的成年礼——以弱胜强。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "除了最开始靠着外援和所谓“英军”打的半吊子独立战争之外，美军从来没有和战略优势甚至均势的敌人开过战。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "近代最接近的时候，只有偷袭珍珠港那么一阵。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "（说实话珍珠港的“危急和被动”根本是想象出来的。日本太平洋舰队根本就没有足够的火力和动力去扫荡太平洋对岸的美国本土——舰载机想跟陆航比航程和火力近乎胡扯。就算把夏威夷让给日本，日本的国力也根本守不住。）", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "甚至可以这么说——美国人根本不知道怎么跟势均力敌甚至占有总体优势的敌人作战。", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦绝对优势不成立、战略突然性完全丧失、主动权发生实实在在的动摇，美军将会进入一个完全陌生的领域。参谋部都不知道该要怎么做作业。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "美军根本无法得知各部队在确知己方处在绝对战略劣势下到底会发生什么变化。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "没有过以弱胜强的经验、传统和心理准备的军队，只是个半成品。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "打赢一场本来会输掉的战争，是一支军队至关重要的淬炼，无可省略，", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 426}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其重要性如同青年成婚，中年失亲，老年丧偶。", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没有经过，就是没有经过，再优秀，也是“没有经历过这些关口的优秀”。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "就像一个小孩子，会算微积分，会做傅立叶变换，会写代码，会打冰球……但是没失过恋，没失过业，没失去过父母……blar blar blar。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "再“强”，也只是个“优秀的孩子”。虽然不排除这个孩子遇到这些事可以顺利过关。", "char_start": 552, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是只要你没有经历过，你的“优秀”就仍然成色不足。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这一点，你只要干几个企业，招一招人，让他们过一过逆境、困境、绝境，你很快就能明白差别何在。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "当你们真的长大成人了，你们就知道这种“优秀的小孩子”跟“强大”相去甚远。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "强大，跟强壮，是两个概念。", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 716}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：现代美军到底有多强？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“强大”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“事实上，美军只是一只不成熟的半成品军队。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "事实上，美军只是一只不成熟的半成品军队。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5172d0f0-a5b3-57c2-945b-2f9a7bf7ac96", "source_ordinal": 2596, "reading_ordinal": 1457, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "计较", "published_at": "2022-09-17T01:27:21+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/280487688/answer/2676947453"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不斤斤计较的人，在决定不跟你计较之后十分钟就找另一个供应商把你替代了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "也就是说，ta们往往是先跟你计较了，计较一下之后发现你这人滚刀肉、装死狗，然后再决定不跟你计较了。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“不跟你计较了”的意思是判你社交死刑了。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "从你的角度看，对方跟你计较过一次。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "软弱无能的人，在跟你计较之前就会决定“不跟你计较”，而且生怕你觉得ta跟你计较了。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "也就是从你的角度来看，ta们一次都没跟你计较过。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "除了搬石头盖住你的井口的那次。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 207}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：心胸开阔不斤斤计较和软弱无能任人宰割的差别在哪？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“计较”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不斤斤计较的人，在决定不跟你计较之后十分钟就找另一个供应商把你替代了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不斤斤计较的人，在决定不跟你计较之后十分钟就找另一个供应商把你替代了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0b762f4e-3abf-5bca-b614-bf33939f7030", "source_ordinal": 2595, "reading_ordinal": 1458, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "洗洗再睡", "published_at": "2022-09-17T13:29:14+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/544977919/answer/2677444343"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为人总存着一种希望——“我现在所受的评价是不公正的。”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不公正的原因在于：", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）或者因为误会、或者因为确实曾经发生的遗憾，评价者对我已经有了成见，这个成见看上去将会永远发生作用，没法解决了。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）现在的评价者自身有某种无法期待会改变的缺陷。也许是偏执、也许是愚蠢、也许是受到身份立场的强烈限定，但无论如何，ta会因此对我作出失真的判断，而我对这些会导致失真的因素无能为力。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "综合而言，我不确定到底是我真的有问题还是对我的评价有问题，所以我需要“干净的样本”来扩充整个评价样本库的容量空间。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "原来我得到的是两个60分、两个30分，解决不了了，为了使得整体的平均评价趋向好评，我需要多几个新评价。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "比如我扩充四个90分，那么平均分就可以从45分提高到67.5，及格了。还是8个样本平均后的及格。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要是我再“去掉所有最高分和所有最低分”，均分就是75啦。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“交浅言深”，本质上只是为了让新的评价获得与老评价同样的权重而产生的基本操作要求。老评价者知道的东西，新评价者当然得的到基本的全面转述才行啊。只说个三分之一，得到的新评价就不能算有效采样，既不能当分子，也不能当分母，没有意义了。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这样说出来，你们可能觉得好笑，但是问题根本不出在“扩大采样寻求更可靠的平均数据”这个基本方法上。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只要你遵循“以所有知情人对我的平均评价作为自我评价的客观基准来决定自己要如何自我改进”这个基本方法，你就必然的会在发现需要付出重大纠错成本之前进行这种“复查”操作。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个“复查操作“在这个“以公论作为为代理真理”的思想体系下是完全合理、完全正当，甚至就是正确的。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "难道你打开门做生意，做的头三个客人给你差评，你就会关上门重新装修和培训整改吗？", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你当然——而且也应该——再多做个几十上百单来等待平均评价。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这有什么不合理和可笑之处？", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "只要你自己是奉行这个基本实践体系的，你之所以没有这样做的根本原因，只是“对目前样本库给你的平均评分感到比较满意”罢了。", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "当这个评价转为令你不满意的时候，你一样会满大街“拉人评评理”，你一定会无法克制的要去扩大样本库，搞一搞更准确的统计。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 874}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为要付出的整改代价如此之大，如此重大的投资，岂能不提前进行“更严肃的调研”？", "char_start": 875, "char_end": 914}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "在这个思想体系下，“扩大样本库”根本就不是错误，“为了使新采样有效而充分暴露数据”也不是错误，要说错误，只有自己在叙述时刻意添油加醋、增删查改、提前筛选调查对象这些隐性的扭曲统计结论有效性的手段才是问题。", "char_start": 915, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "至于因此暴露隐私、招来不必要的伤害，这个可以用“我有一个朋友”、“假设有这种情况”、以及匿名交流来技术性解决。这并不是原则性问题。", "char_start": 1018, "char_end": 1083}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但是，注意这个一切的总前提——在这个“以公论作为代理真理”的思想体系下。", "char_start": 1084, "char_end": 1120}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "问题在于——这个总前提是否成立？", "char_start": 1122, "char_end": 1138}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "heading", "index": 23, "text": "“公论”——更不必说由“调查员”（尽管是不由自主的、下意识的、不自知的）操纵问卷、筛选调查对象、调整统计算法得出的所谓“公论”，能不能有效的“代理真理”？", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1216}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "认为“能”，你今日笑人，迟早你亦为人所笑。没有任何手段可以帮你“避免”。", "char_start": 1217, "char_end": 1253}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "认为“不能”，你就要找到其他的评价体系来替代这个公论的角色。", "char_start": 1254, "char_end": 1284}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "如果你找不到，你必定还是要回到这个“最不坏的办法”。", "char_start": 1285, "char_end": 1311}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "今日笑人，迟早亦必为人所笑。", "char_start": 1312, "char_end": 1326}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "只要你要靠“样本库”来担当“真理发生器”，这个“洗样本库”的内在冲动，你就不可能遏制。", "char_start": 1328, "char_end": 1371}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这就是“尘网”的本质。", "char_start": 1372, "char_end": 1383}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "凭空扔了它，你的潜艇立刻导航失灵。", "char_start": 1385, "char_end": 1402}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "想要从此停在太平洋中间水下六十米处，在你的核潜艇上“安居乐业”，你办不到。", "char_start": 1404, "char_end": 1441}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "只有找到比它性能更好的替代件，才是唯一的解。", "char_start": 1443, "char_end": 1465}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "只有找到这个替代件，你才能断了这烦恼根源，停止用“无限扩大样本库，再用力洗一洗数据”来替代“重大高风险改造投资”。", "char_start": 1466, "char_end": 1523}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "洗数据是有成本的，一直洗下去会比“重大高风险改造投资”的成本更高。而你先洗两年，实在洗不过来再投入“改造投资”，你付出的可是双倍。", "char_start": 1524, "char_end": 1589}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "但你如果数据一不妙就“重大高风险改造投资”，你会经常“先投资建墙，再投资把墙拆了”。", "char_start": 1590, "char_end": 1632}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "找到替代件，解决对“公论”的绝对依赖，就是开悟的数学原理。", "char_start": 1634, "char_end": 1663}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这就是正确答案，不必再找了。", "char_start": 1665, "char_end": 1679}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有一种人喜欢剥开自己给别人看，容易交浅言深，事后还后悔？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“洗洗再睡”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为人总存着一种希望——“我现在所受的评价是不公正的。””", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为人总存着一种希望——“我现在所受的评价是不公正的。”", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6740f6cd-4fca-56bb-8a44-c33d6d96f1c3", "source_ordinal": 2594, "reading_ordinal": 1459, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "结果的结果的结果", "published_at": "2022-09-17T21:09:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/265463586/answer/2677974935"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "杭州史称临安，南宋所谓“行在”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "行——跑路。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在——落脚点。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "跑得够远了找个石头蹲一蹲，喘口气。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "天下大难，于是全国文人士绅都跟着跑路，都跑到一个地方，长吁短叹了个几十一百年，这是最容易造成“历史文化名城”的搞法。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "北以色列灭亡，北方贵族全跑路到耶路撒冷，于是“耶路撒冷三千年”，这就是个“中东的杭州”。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "西罗马帝国崩溃，破落贵族富商们一股脑跑路到君士坦丁堡瑟瑟发抖，是为君士坦丁堡、伊斯坦布尔，至今是欧洲人口最多的城市，这是个“西方的杭州”。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "旧中国动荡、沙俄崩溃，造就了上海。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "日寇入侵，造就了香港。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "国民党崩溃，造就了侯孝贤的台北。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一战二战，造就了纽约。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这就是“杭州有名”的故事的根源。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所谓这名人、那轶事，只是“临安”造成的结果的结果。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而“有名”，更是这结果的结果的结果。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 345}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：武汉东湖为何一直没杭州西湖有名？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“结果的结果的结果”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“杭州史称临安，南宋所谓“行在”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "杭州史称临安，南宋所谓“行在”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "45005b86-f7a5-5c95-80d0-7bb2d0423ec0", "source_ordinal": 2593, "reading_ordinal": 1460, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "再全球化", "published_at": "2022-09-18T03:44:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/553908636/answer/2678296059"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "欧美媒体——顺带也影响了中国的媒体意识——一只有一个极为愚蠢、傲慢、而且是根本性错误的认知——就是把中国正在做的事叫做“区域化”、“逆全球化”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "他们总是不假思索的认为接下来的戏码是“两边翻脸，各自拉帮结派”，以及“新人想要把老群主踢下去自己当群主”。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "他们所设想的下一个历史稳态是“几大国各自各搞一摊，保证自己的供应链安全”，所有的人都要选一颗大树抱着乘凉，然后大家回到中世纪欧洲领主割据状态，所以大喊“去全球化”“逆全球化”“区域化”。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "台媒也跟着在边上摇旗喊。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "带动国内喜欢抄东西、跟热源的公众号、“大V”们一起喊。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "中国真的是要学美国搞一个自己的小帮派、私人俱乐部，然后跟美国“划洋而治”吗？", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这属于对中国的基本政治传统、文化信仰、策略方法论缺少基本的了解。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "简单来说，因为傲慢而根本不读中国的、尤其是中国共产党的历史。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "中国现在在搞的，根本不是“区域经济再整合”，更不是什么“逆全球化”，而是再全球化。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一个由“南南国家”为主体、为核心、为主导的新的全球化。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "经济循环的基本原理其实不复杂——先有需求，然后有信用体系去支撑生产关系（典型的就是货币资本以工资为支点安排生产角色、构建生产组织，钱本质上是信用），由生产关系舞动生产工具、改造资源，制造出产品和服务，满足需求。需求被满足，会改善人类的整体能力和构造，使得人类能从自然界中更有效的获得更多的资源、并且借由这个体系进行有效的分配，改善所有人的福利。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 608}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而这跟旧的全球化崩溃有什么关系？", "char_start": 609, "char_end": 625}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "旧的全球化崩溃的核心原因，在于旧的体系的核心逻辑是“全球齐心协力满足发达国家的需求”。", "char_start": 626, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "heading", "index": 14, "text": "而发达国家的需求，即使穷奢极欲化，也仍然不足以支撑真正的全球化的充分运转。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这整个循环中，资源和能力实际上是客观存在、而且经过技术革命后完全过剩的。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一个经典的例子，就是人类目前生产的食物完全可以轻松的养活全部的人口。", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "何止粮食，让天下不再有衣不蔽体、不再有无处容身，仅从产能、资源储量和扩充产能的潜力上讲，根本没有任何原则性的瓶颈。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个循环的短板在于另外两方面——真实的需求和可靠的信用。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 866}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "可靠的信用说穿了就是币值稳定、购买力足够有效的货币。这在当年几乎完全由发达国家垄断。", "char_start": 867, "char_end": 909}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "既然发达国家垄断了这个要素，它们很自然的绑架了需求这个要素。", "char_start": 910, "char_end": 940}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "它们凭着这个特权，将这循环里的需求定义成了“发达国家的需求”。", "char_start": 941, "char_end": 972}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而旧体系崩溃的根源，根本不是什么“中国威胁美国霸权”，而是发达国家的真实需求已经穷尽了。", "char_start": 973, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你家有一块草坪要修剪管理，那么所有的发展中国家就可以为你提供园丁、草皮、肥料、水管……甚至是水。", "char_start": 1018, "char_end": 1066}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "但你有几块草坪？", "char_start": 1067, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你浑身是嘴，一天吃六顿，你能吃多少？", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "超过了健康、可持续的限度的需求只是假的需求，这类需求满足需要成本，但是却并不能兑换为人类从自然界获得资源的更多能力。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1153}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果能，上帝会通过让更多物质财富进入人类的经济体系来“买单”。", "char_start": 1154, "char_end": 1185}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "如果不会，满足这些需求的努力在本质上就会化为一缕青烟——哪怕它换回了一张绿纸，但却仅仅只是改变了人类对同一总量的物质财富的分配权重——绿纸越多的份额越大而已。", "char_start": 1186, "char_end": 1265}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "问题在于，发达国家一共就这么十来亿人，去掉老弱病残这些其实并不直接与自然打交道的人口，真正产生能扩大人类与自然关系的真实需求的人口还要在这个基础上打个三折。", "char_start": 1266, "char_end": 1344}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这三四亿人，没有这么多需求。", "char_start": 1345, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "它们能提供的需求，对于人口占到五六十亿的发展中国家而言，存在系统性的缺口，直接扼死了旧全球化的规模上限。", "char_start": 1360, "char_end": 1412}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "为了推升这一上限、延迟上限崩溃的时间，发达国家早已开始塞入假需求——纯属消费、享乐、浪费的需求。", "char_start": 1413, "char_end": 1461}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而即使考虑到这些穷奢极欲，这个需求总量也仍然无法保证第三世界的充分就业。", "char_start": 1462, "char_end": 1498}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这才是现在世界秩序的根本问题。", "char_start": 1499, "char_end": 1514}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "因为真实的需求——满足了可以进一步提升人类从自然中获得物质财富能力的需求，其实天灯更多的在发展中国家手中。", "char_start": 1515, "char_end": 1568}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "不但如此，“足够稳定且有足够购买能力的货币”现在也已经不再稀缺了——尤其是在欧美一轮一轮的“量化宽松”、自降竞争力之后，这些劣化后的信用凭证泛滥成灾，都开始投NFT这类伪需求了，何来稀缺？", "char_start": 1569, "char_end": 1663}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "货币不稀缺了，而唯一的短板——需求——实际上在发展中国家手中。", "char_start": 1664, "char_end": 1695}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "一个地主撑破天也就吃几斤饭，全村的穷人们一顿就要吃一推车。", "char_start": 1696, "char_end": 1725}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "要想突破这瓶颈，就必须将“服务于发达国家需求的全球化体系”转变为“服务于发展中国家需求的全球化体系”。", "char_start": 1726, "char_end": 1777}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "只有这样，国际贸易的总规模才能踏上新的数量级，才能在世界范围内抑制失业、通胀和政治动荡。", "char_start": 1778, "char_end": 1822}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "这是数学的必然，天道所向。", "char_start": 1823, "char_end": 1836}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "所谓“人类命运共同体”，就是要把全球生产体系所关注的核心客户从发达国家转向广大的发展中国家。", "char_start": 1837, "char_end": 1883}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "从全村抢地主一家那几个菜的订单，转向全村人去做全村人的午餐订单。", "char_start": 1884, "char_end": 1916}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "这个新的架构，才能彻底消除旧有的“以发达国家为经济中心”的所有瓶颈，才是下一段历史的真正稳态。", "char_start": 1917, "char_end": 1964}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "我们“拉帮结派”？", "char_start": 1965, "char_end": 1974}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "我们是要从稳固的根据地出发，进入广大“农村”中去，开展减租减税运动、发动土地改革、发动群众参加“红军”，最后“农村”包围“城市”。", "char_start": 1975, "char_end": 2040}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "只不过是全球版的。", "char_start": 2041, "char_end": 2050}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "我们是要完成以发展中国家为核心主体的再全球化。", "char_start": 2052, "char_end": 2075}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "等到这个再全球化的进程成了燎原之势，我们并没有拒绝欧美国家放下现在的主子心态加入进来的打算。", "char_start": 2077, "char_end": 2123}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "它们如果不想自绝于这个新全球化的体系，它们最终就将没有选择。", "char_start": 2125, "char_end": 2155}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "其实这些都是明摆着的。", "char_start": 2156, "char_end": 2167}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "只是它们太傲慢了，根本不去读中国的革命史，只是自以为自己是终极智慧代表，强迫症一般的以为所谓“最佳策略”肯定是对他们自己那一套的模仿罢了，所以一直在自己的那点执念里兜圈子。", "char_start": 2168, "char_end": 2254}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 55, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：上合组织成员国元首签署《撒马尔罕宣言》，释放哪些信息？「逆全球化」思潮涌动，区域性国际组织将去向何处？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052"], "summary": "围绕“再全球化”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“欧美媒体——顺带也影响了中国的媒体意识——一只有一个极为愚蠢、傲慢、而且是根本性错误的认知——就是把中国正在做的事叫做“区域化”、“逆全球化”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "欧美媒体——顺带也影响了中国的媒体意识——一只有一个极为愚蠢、傲慢、而且是根本性错误的认知——就是把中国正在做的事叫做“区域化”、“逆全球化”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 72, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1fb11f11-3b90-5193-9239-70a4cca8338b", "source_ordinal": 2592, "reading_ordinal": 1461, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不同节奏", "published_at": "2022-09-19T00:52:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/552876594/answer/2679568286"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "老实说，这个主题说过很多遍了，现在再说一次。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是的，你是有了和别人不一样的节奏，但是这不见得是坏事。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这可以——注意，我没说“一定”——可以在将来成为一件好事。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "全看你自己把这件事向好的方向孵化、还是向坏的方向孵化。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人生根本不是“一步落后、步步落后”的“竞争”。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人生是万千角色之间的合作。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "有的角色，需要的就是“早年有过抑郁经历”的背景——典型的比如作家、导演这类艺术家。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "上帝眼里没有主角，每一个出现在演员表上的人都是平等的。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你并不是祂所导演的一部历史大剧里完全无足轻重的兵丁甲，而是他导演的七十几亿部剧中其中一部的主角、七八部剧中的男/女二、三、四，一千多部中的群演，以及剩下六十九亿九千九百九十九万九千部中的故事背景。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这还只是这一季，你还会是将来无数续集的“前传”。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而在这些剧里面，“正常升学、顺利入职、就势成婚、平安生子……”的“标准规格人生”，并没有特殊的优胜。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "世界上的精彩故事并不能缺了各种各样的“非标准件”。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "尤其是人工智能大行其道的将来，成为一个少数派、一个有特殊履历、特殊背景、特殊意识的人，未必是一件坏事。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以不必对此过于焦虑。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "上帝给你发这副牌，对你不是恶意。不要一心认为这是“倒大霉”。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 513}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "“别人都没有，怎么就我有”。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "是啊，别人都没有，就你有，你仔细想想这话，真的一定是坏事吗？", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "如果你静下心来，顺势而为，在这个给你的特殊起点上努力发育，将来这个“别人都没有就我有”，总有一天会变成“怎么就ta行，我们都不行”。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这件事只是特殊的，它到底将来孵化成好的还是坏的，还在未定之天，还取决于你。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果你选对了，这其实是特殊的祝福。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 682}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "以后遇到任何“为什么别人没有就我有”，都往这方向想一想。", "char_start": 683, "char_end": 711}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：抑郁焦虑休学了一年多，但还是极度厌学恐惧学校怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“不同节奏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“老实说，这个主题说过很多遍了，现在再说一次。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "老实说，这个主题说过很多遍了，现在再说一次。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ec47187c-e33f-5a1b-b21d-5e62a44cea5d", "source_ordinal": 2591, "reading_ordinal": 1462, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "春眠不觉晓", "published_at": "2022-09-21T19:53:39+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/553088677/answer/2683808942"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "美国科技股、电影工业是美国金融战略的最大受益者。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这就是ta们可以“烧钱”的根本原因。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那些美好的福利、“稳定的职业生涯”“高度人性化的工作方式”“宽容的多元文化”“激进的战略研究和技术储备”“天马行空的视觉奇观和IP探索”……背后其实都是钱、钱、钱。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这些都是要成本的，而这些钱不是赚的、不是攒的。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这么多钱的秘诀，在于“实际融资成本接近于0”。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "实际融资成本等于0，人就敢肆无忌惮的花钱。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "小于0，那么就会开始为各种梦想花钱。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我借1000万，经过百分之二十膨胀之后却只需要还你1100万——越借得多、要还的越少，不借岂不是傻瓜吗？借到就直接赚了，借得越多，赚得越多。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“实际融资利率为负”，再加上破产保护，就是“无限金钱”的意思。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只要这一个条件，买起设备来岂能不豪爽？对照组一次设四个，岂不比只设一个快四倍？拍起片子来做上四个镜头来挑，岂能不充满张力？", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "为什么“发达国家”喜欢搞负利率，这是根本原因之一。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "利率如果是正的，就会导致国资和财团的垄断——因为它们的实际利率低于其他小企业（很可能只有它们是负的，别人都是正的），这是极大的优势。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果利率不但正，而且很高，那么“创新”的风险就会明显的大于模仿，会把该经济体的业态牢牢的固定在“跟随模仿”的模式。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这其实就是“美国科技奇迹”的本质，也是中国“缺少创意、热爱抄袭”的底层原因。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "为什么要争人民币的国际化？为了尽早达成“融资成本逼近零”的关键临界点。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "越逼近于零，中国越能转向大胆超越的技术创新、越能支撑天马行空的文艺创作。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这些职位有了、成就有了，自然能孵化出一大堆科技和文艺IP来，属于中国的漫威、星球大战、星际旅行才能出得来。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "悟空才能好歹歇一歇。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不过我倒不认为中国会选择低于0，这是个文化问题。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "“借钱负利率”这种颠倒阴阳的事，中国人恐怕永远不可能接受。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "成也宋江，败也宋江。一旦美国的金融战略出了问题——比如要吸血的对象没血了，或者这一季的韭菜长了根铁杆——这整个机制的上游就要断流。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "上游断流，硅谷和好莱坞也会是最早感受到寒冷的地方。一旦要饿肚子，“梦想”是最先被抛弃的东西。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 877}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这种裁员对企业会有什么影响？", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 893}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "其实这些人很多就是在搞一些未必用得上、只是准备拿来讲故事的美梦。", "char_start": 894, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "没钱就少做点梦就好了。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "正所谓：", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "春眠不觉晓，处处闻啼鸟。", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "夜来风雨声，花落知多少。", "char_start": 957, "char_end": 969}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0227"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：美国社交媒体公司 Snap 实施一项大规模裁员超 1200 人的计划，此次裁员会给企业带来哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“春眠不觉晓”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“美国科技股、电影工业是美国金融战略的最大受益者。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "美国科技股、电影工业是美国金融战略的最大受益者。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
